 To reschedule your dental check-up, I will use the `reschedule_calendar_event` function with the following parameters:

```json
{
  "name": "reschedule_calendar_event",
  "arguments": {
    "event_id": "<your event ID>",
    "new_start_time": "2024-05-20T10:00"
  }
}
```

Please replace `<your event ID>` with the actual ID of your dental check-up event. The new start time is set to May 20, 2024, at 10:00. This will reschedule the event and send an email notification to the participants about the change.
